<title>USA: PECO Pa. Peach Bottom nuke unit at 100 pct.</title>
<headline>PECO Pa. Peach Bottom nuke unit at 100 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>PECO Energy Co's 1,100 megawatt Peach Bottom 2 nuclear power unit in Delta, Pa., is operating at full power after returning to the electricity grid early Friday afternoon, the company said Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;All of our units are back up,&quot; said company spokesman Michael Wood.</p>
<p>The unit was taken off line last Wednesday due to a problem with the oil line to the generator.</p>
<p>--H McCulloch, New York Power Desk +212-859-1628</p>
